@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/[topic_uuid]/actions/toggle_done/invoke
actor "Der Client" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamTopicController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nKanonische Zeilen + Anschlüsse" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ Typisierte Aufgaben ausführen" as Outbox
participant "Hintergrund-Bauern\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "Fertige Projektionen\nKontainerbindungen" as Projection
database "Speicher für öffentliche Veranstaltungen" as Events
participant "- Das ist der Controller . WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "Der Client WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/{topic_uuid}/actions/toggle_done/invoke
API -> DB: lock canonical TOPIC; toggle is_done;\nversion++, updated_at; append immutable outbox
DB --> API: Transaktion festzulegen
API --> Client: eine erfolgreiche öffentliche Antwort
DB ->> Outbox: festgehaltenes Ereignis
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable topic_state_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=(project_id, topic_uuid)
Worker -> Worker: claim exact topic scope + fencing
group Einer DB transaction
  Worker -> Projection: - freiwillig read-only copy aus TOPIC
  Worker -> Events: ready topic.updated für alle sichtbaren users
end
Events ->> Dispatcher: festgelegte bereitgestellte Zeile
Dispatcher ->> WS: Versenden / Wiederholen / Wiederholen
@enduml
